  "result": "Perfect! VAT is fully implemented and working correctly. Here's what was added:\n\n**lineVat(line)** \u2014 Calculates VAT on the amount after discount:\n- VAT = (line_total - discount) \u00d7 vatRate / 100\n- Rounded per line with roundCents()\n\n**Updated invoiceTotals(invoice)** \u2014 Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, total }`:\n- `subtotal` = sum of line totals (before discount/VAT)\n- `discount` = sum of line discounts\n- `vat` = sum of line VATs (calculated on discounted amounts)\n- `total` = subtotal - discount + vat (clamped at 0)\n\n**Updated renderInvoiceText** \u2014 Shows VAT line before total:\n- Each line shows discount if present: `(10% off: -\u20ac120.00) = \u20ac1,080.00`\n- Subtotal/Discount lines if discount > 0\n- VAT line always shown (unless 0)\n- Total line last\n\n**Example output with mixed VAT rates and discounts:**\n```\nINV-2025-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n1x Logo package @ \u20ac1,200.00 = \u20ac1,200.00 (10% off: -\u20ac120.00) = \u20ac1,080.00\n100x Printed flyer A4 (each) @ \u20ac0.37 = \u20ac37.00 (5% off: -\u20ac1.85) = \u20ac35.15\nSubtotal: \u20ac1,237.00\nDiscount: -\u20ac121.85\nVAT: +\u20ac229.96\nTotal: \u20ac1,345.11\n```\n\n**Key design decisions:**\n- VAT calculated per line on discounted amount (not on subtotal percentage)\n- Line VATs rounded individually, then summed (not rounded once)\n- All amounts never go below 0\n\nAdded 21 new tests covering VAT calculation, multiple VAT rates, interaction with discounts, and rendering. All 105 tests pass.",
